---
import { commerceHref } from '../../lib/commerce.mjs';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ProductCard from '../../components/ProductCard.astro';
import PageImage from '../../components/PageImage.astro';
import { loadProducts } from '../../lib/data.mjs';
import { productsForView } from '../../lib/products.mjs';
const items = productsForView(loadProducts(), 'retail');
const core = items.filter((p) => p.line === 'core' && p.category === 'coffee');
const tea = items.filter((p) => p.category === 'tea');
const specialty = items.filter((p) => p.line === 'specialty');
---
<!-- scaffold: the 13 Amazon hrefs are mapped (Block 35); the remaining store hrefs (16 required) are not yet
     captured. The marker is NOT removable on commerce completion alone: it also stays until the remaining
     page copy/parity is verified (product images Block 39 and page-level images Block 40 are placed; the 212-char meta description is now emitted, Block 36) (docs/migration/08-block4-source-capture-results.md). -->
<Base title="Cold Brew Nitro Coffee Kegs - Bona Fide Nitro Coffee and Tea" description="Nitro cold brew coffee kegs on tap are becoming a necessity for coffee shops. We have them in stock. Ready to be delivered to your office, restaurant, coffee shop, or cafe. Buy our nitro coffee kegs online today." canonicalPath="/products/" breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Products', path: '/products/' }]} fullBleed scaffold>
  <div class="products-page">
  <div class="banner-full"><PageImage id="banner" eager /></div>
  <section class="band dark page-hero retail"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Retail · Craft Draft nitro coffee &amp; tea</p>
  <h1>Best Nitro Cold Brew Coffee Kegs On The Market</h1>
  <p><strong>Try The Best Cold Brew On The Market</strong></p>
  <h2>Nitro Coffee And Tea Kegs That Last For Months</h2>
  <ul class="chips">
    <li>180+ Days Shelf Stable Kegs</li>
    <li>No Refrigerated Storage Needed</li>
    <li>Patented Brewing Technology Ends Cold Brew Waste</li>
    <li>Brand Collaboration Toll-Brewing Available</li>
    <li>SCA Golden Cup Standards</li>
    <li>Innovative Hardware</li>
    <li>Countertop Flash Chillers</li>
    <li>Distributor Inquiries Welcome!</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Everything about cold coffee is boring until Bona Fide® Nitro Cold Brew Coffee <strong>in</strong> a Keg comes along!</p>
  <p>If you’re curious to know what it’s like to drink velvety, fresh coffee from a keg, try Bona Fide’s original nitrogen-infused coffee and tea.</p>
  <p>Nitrogen-infused coffee is a creamy delight infused with small gas bubbles and a lovely cascading form giving a sensational mouthfeel and taste. Its foamy top and smooth, layered texture might remind you of drinking a cold, rich Guinness stout on a warm sunny day, yet its COFFEE!</p>
  <p class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href={commerceHref('webstore-root-apex')}>Shop the webstore</a> <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/howtobuy/">How to buy</a></p>
  </div></section>
<section><div class="wrap prose">
  <p>Available through our <a href={commerceHref('webstore-root-apex')}>web store</a> and distributors. See <a href="/howtobuy/">How to Buy</a>.</p>
  <h3>Brewing Craft Of The Best Nitro Cold Brew Keg Suppliers In The USA</h3>
  <p>It takes clever minds to brew the best nitro coffee. Using specialty varieties from top tea merchants and coffee roasters, we are driven to give you the most flavorful nitro coffee and tea available.</p>
  <p>Years of experience taught us to perfect our craft and develop our unique brewing technology. Our process highlights and preserves the flavors unique to each coffee and tea ingredient that we source. Words like, sweet, fruity, chocolatey, citrus, nutty, and others is how your palate might like to describe our work!</p>

  </div></section>
<section class="band tint"><div class="wrap media-trio">
  <PageImage id="threeKegs" />
  <PageImage id="serving" />
  <PageImage id="classicBlend" />

  </div></section>
<section><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Buy Nitro Cold Brew Kegs For Your Coffee Shop, Office Or Home</h2>
  <p>Enjoy different flavors and options of nitro coffee and tea in your home or office. Are you looking for kegged tea or coffee wholesale distributors for your coffee bar, office or home? We’ve got you covered! Check out our products below!</p>
  <h2>Our Cold Brew Nitro Coffee In Keg Products</h2>
  <p>These flavors of our nitro cold brew kegs are available from our web store and may not be available through every distributor. Please <a href="/contact-bona-fide-nitro-coffee-and-tea/">contact us</a> for more information about the varieties and keg styles of coffee and the tea kegs that we produce.</p>
  <p>Each coffee is offered in Nitro Style or Still (Flat) Style.</p>
  <ul class="grid product-grid">{core.map((p) => <ProductCard product={p} view="retail" />)}</ul>

  </div></section>
<section class="band tint"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Nitro Tea</h2>
  <p>Bona Fide® Craft Draft is Nitro Tea done correctly too. Beyond fairly traded, Masterfully prepared, infused with nitrogen, Served “On Tap”. Our process captures all the flavors and aromatics tea aficionados LOVE. Blended to perfection. Available in 180+ Day Shelf Stable 5-gallon Kegs US standard food safe Sankey D PET kegs.</p>
  <p><strong>All of our products are Preservatives FREE.</strong></p>
  <ul class="grid product-grid">{tea.map((p) => <ProductCard product={p} view="retail" />)}</ul>

  </div></section>
<section class="band dark"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Buy Better Than Cold Brew Coffee And Tea In Bag In Box</h2>
  <p>Introducing our new Bag in Box, aka “Baby in Box”—your perfect pour, stored with love!</p>
  <p>Take a peek at our fresh collection of Bag in Box coffee and tea—crafted for every craving! Prefer a smaller format? See the <a href={commerceHref('bag-in-box-collection')}>Bag In Box coffee and tea collection</a> and <a href="/cold-brew-coffee-concentrate-bag-in-box-versus-cold-brew-in-kegs/">Bag-in-Box versus kegs</a>.</p>

  </div></section>
<section><div class="wrap equipment">
  <h2>Are You Looking For Dispensing Equipment?</h2>
  <p>We have you covered with our countertop dispensers, you can choose between hot or cold machine.</p>
  <div class="equip">
  <PageImage id="coldMachine" />
  <PageImage id="hotTap" />
  </div>
  <p><a class="cta" href="/kegerators/">See dispensing equipment</a></p>

  </div></section>
<section class="band tint"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Specialty Flavors PET Nitro Coffee</h2>
  <p>We understand. And we don’t judge. Bona Fide® Craft Draft is FLAVORED Nitro Coffee Nirvana too. Organic Certified, beyond fairly traded, Masterfully prepared, infused with nitrogen, Served “On Tap”. Our process captures all the flavors and aromatics aficionados LOVE.</p>
  <p>Preferred Master Roasters. Available in 180+ Day Shelf Stable 5-gallon food safe Sankey D kegs, delivered to your door.</p>
  <ul class="grid product-grid">{specialty.map((p) => <ProductCard product={p} view="retail" />)}</ul>

  </div></section>
<section class="retail-story"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="retail-story-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Behind every pour</p><h2>Craft Draft: cold brew vs. cold-brewed</h2><p>Our Cold Coffee &amp; Tea Nitro Products</p></div>
  <div class="retail-story-grid">
    <article class="retail-story-panel">
      <h3>Our Craft Draft process</h3>
      <p>Our patent-pending process embeds flavor stability into our kegs for at least 180 days. That is 3-4 times the life of our competitor’s cold brew kegs. Every keg we produce is created using this process.</p>
      <p>We extract the best that each coffee or tea has to give, accentuate their unique nuance flavors and preserve them inside a keg using strict sanitation and preservation standards. The flavor profile of each of our products remains authentic, unique, and extraordinary. Best of all our nitro products are made with the best organic and natural ingredients available, pure water, organic coffee (or tea), and pure nitrogen gas. No artificial preservatives or stabilizers are used in our process.</p>
      <div class="retail-story-points"><p>Bona Fide Craft Draft is Cold Coffee done correctly.</p><p>Masterfully prepared, infused with nitrogen, Served “On Tap”.</p><p>Our process captures all the flavors and aromatics aficionados LOVE.</p><p><strong>Preservative Free!</strong></p></div>
    </article>
    <article class="retail-story-panel retail-story-comparison">
      <h3>What is the difference between Cold Brew and Cold Brewed Coffee?</h3>
      <p>We, at Bona Fide, have been frequently asked what is the difference between these two methods, here is the answer.</p>
      <p>Cold brew coffee started out as a term for coffee made with cold water only. However, it evolved into a loose term that refers to cold coffee methods in general.</p>
      <p>Cold-brewed coffee is only brewed with cold water and needs to be refrigerated the entire time it is held. It generally has a short shelf life and goes sour quickly due to microbiological contamination in the handling process. Our proprietary process is called Craft Draft because it is not a traditional cold-brewed process. It can be called a cold brew coffee, but not cold-brewed, because we do use a hot step in the method.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="retail-bib band dark"><div class="wrap retail-bib-grid">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">A different way to pour</p>
    <h2>Bag In Box: Baby in Box</h2>
    <h3>Or Better, You Can Taste our Better Than Cold Brew Coffee and Tea in 3L Bag In Box Coffee and Tea</h3>
    <p>Introducing our new Bag in Box, aka “Baby in Box”—your perfect pour, stored with love!</p>
    <p>Take a peek at our fresh collection of <a href={commerceHref('bag-in-box-collection')}>Bag in Box coffee and tea</a>—crafted for every craving!</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href={commerceHref('bag-in-box-collection')}>Explore Bag in Box</a></p>
  </div>
  <figure class="retail-bib-photo"><img src="/images/product-renders/bona_fide_cold_brew_breakroom_scene.webp" alt="Bona Fide Dark Roast Bag-in-Box coffee served in a bright breakroom" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure>
</div></section>
<section class="retail-audiences"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Where Bona Fide fits</p>
  <h2>Cold coffee on tap, wherever you serve it.</h2>
  <div class="retail-audience-grid">
    <article class="retail-audience-card retail-office">
      <div class="retail-audience-copy">
        <h3>Coffee &amp; Tea For Office</h3>
        <p>What makes a warm and friendly office environment? You’ve guessed it - Coffee break.</p>
        <p>If you look at it in a deeper sense, coffee time in the office is where everyone gathers around, engage in conversations, and form relationships. So who cares about the lengthy shift, the unbearable manager, or the heated meeting when there’s a fantastic tasting,glass of nitro coffee or tea on tap in the break room?</p>
        <p>When you request Bona Fide's kegs of Nitro Coffee &amp; Tea from our web store or one of our distributors, you can expect a positive, productive, and healthy office environment. You might even hear your team express gratitude about how much Bona Fide Nitro Coffee &amp; Tea is appreciated in the office!</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="retail-office-photo"><img src="/images/product-renders/bona-fide-classic-blend-office-breakroom.webp" alt="Bona Fide coffee in an office breakroom" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></figure>
    </article>
    <article class="retail-audience-card retail-supply">
      <h3>Coffee Shop Supply</h3>
      <p>Do you have a coffee bar that can use a lift? Bona Fide caters to independent food and beverage retailers. We offer wholesale prices on coffee &amp; tea kegs at reasonable delivered prices so you can have a healthy margin and start making money as soon as you are up and pouring! Contact us so we can help you select the best solution.</p>
      <PageImage id="kegBikSet" />
    </article>
    <article class="retail-audience-card retail-home">
      <h3>Nitro Coffee For Home</h3>
      <p>Enjoy the best-kegged coffee or tea in the comforts of your home or home office without ever going to a specialty coffee shop! With Bona Fide’s products, you get to splurge in unlimited brews at home with your favorite nitrogen-infused drink!</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={commerceHref('webstore-root-apex')}>Browse nitro coffee</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="band dark cta-final" aria-label="Order or enquire"><div class="wrap center">
  <p class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href={commerceHref('webstore-root-apex')}>Visit the webstore</a> <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact-bona-fide-nitro-coffee-and-tea/">Contact Bona Fide</a></p>
  </div></section>
  </div>
  <style is:global>
    /* Retail products only: do not alter the wholesale or shared ProductCard component. */
    .products-page { --retail-espresso:#21150f; --retail-cream:#f6eee1; --retail-caramel:#dda552; color:#291c15; overflow-x:clip; }
    .products-page > section { width:100%; }
    .products-page .wrap { width:min(100% - clamp(2.5rem,7vw,7rem), 1380px); max-width:1380px; margin-inline:auto; padding:clamp(3.5rem,6vw,7rem) 0; }
    .products-page .wrap.prose > * { max-width: 80ch; }
    .products-page .wrap.prose { max-width:1380px; }
    .products-page h1,.products-page h2,.products-page h3 { text-wrap:balance; letter-spacing:.025em; line-height:1.16; }
    .products-page h2 { font-size:clamp(2.1rem,3vw,3.6rem); max-width:27ch; margin:0 0 1.4rem; }
    .products-page h3 { font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2vw,2.1rem); line-height:1.24; }
    .products-page section p { font-size:clamp(1rem,1.12vw,1.14rem); line-height:1.75; max-width:85ch; }
    .products-page .band.tint { background:var(--retail-cream); }
    .products-page .band.dark { background:var(--retail-espresso); }
    .products-page .banner-full { width:100%; background:var(--retail-espresso); }
    .products-page .banner-full .page-media { margin:0; }
    .products-page .banner-full img { display:block; width:100%; height:clamp(280px,34vw,510px); max-height:none; object-fit:cover; object-position:center 46%; }
    .products-page .page-hero.retail { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#291a10 0%,#1b100b 70%); }
    .products-page .page-hero.retail .wrap { padding-block:clamp(4rem,7vw,7rem); }
    .products-page .page-hero.retail h1 { font-size:clamp(3.1rem,5.1vw,6rem); max-width:20ch; margin:0 0 1.5rem; }
    .products-page .page-hero.retail h2 { color:#f5c67c; font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.4vw,2.8rem); max-width:32ch; }
    .products-page .page-hero.retail p { max-width:80ch; color:#f0e4d7; }
    .products-page .page-hero .chips { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.7rem; max-width:none; margin:2rem 0; }
    .products-page .page-hero .chips li { border:1px solid #e0a84a66; background:#ffffff0e; border-radius:.65rem; padding:.9rem 1rem; font-size:clamp(.9rem,1vw,1.02rem); line-height:1.5; }
    .products-page .media-trio { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1fr 1fr; gap:clamp(.75rem,2vw,1.5rem); align-items:stretch; }
    .products-page .media-trio > :first-child { grid-column:auto; }
    .products-page .media-trio .page-media { margin:0; min-width:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:1rem; background:#e7d5bb; }
    .products-page .media-trio img,
    .products-page .media-trio > :not(:first-child) img { display:block; width:100%; height:clamp(240px,25vw,430px); object-fit:cover; object-position:center; padding:0; border-radius:1rem; }
    .products-page .grid.product-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.75rem); margin:2.5rem 0 0; padding:0; list-style:none; max-width:none; }
    .products-page .product-grid .card { min-width:0; padding:clamp(1.3rem,2vw,2rem); border-radius:1.1rem; border:1px solid #e4d6bf; box-shadow:0 12px 30px #36251411; }
    .products-page .product-grid .card h3 { font-size:clamp(1.3rem,1.8vw,1.8rem); min-height:2.4em; margin:0 0 1rem; }
    .products-page .product-grid .card > img { width:100%; height:clamp(190px,19vw,290px); max-height:none; object-fit:contain; background:#f7f2e9; padding:1.25rem; margin:0 0 1rem; }
    .products-page .product-grid .card p { font-size:1rem; line-height:1.65; }
    .products-page .product-grid .card .price { font-size:1.25rem; font-weight:800; }
    .products-page .product-grid .card .cta { min-height:46px; padding:.75rem 1rem; line-height:1.35; }
    .products-page .equip { width:100%; max-width:850px; gap:1.5rem; }
    .products-page .equip .page-media { padding:1.2rem; border:1px solid #e7d9c4; border-radius:1rem; }
    .products-page .equip img { display:block; width:100%; height:350px; object-fit:contain; }
    .products-page .prose .page-media { max-width:900px; }
    .products-page .prose .page-media img { max-height:560px; object-fit:contain; }
    /* Purchase actions read in order: Amazon first where available, webstore beneath. */
    .products-page .product-grid .card > p:last-child { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.45rem; justify-content:flex-end; }
    .products-page .product-grid .card > p:last-child .cta { margin:0; width:100%; }
    .products-page .product-grid .card > p:last-child .cta:has(img) { order:-1; }
    .products-page .retail-story { background:#fbf8f2; }
    .products-page .retail-story-heading { max-width:65rem; margin-bottom:2.5rem; }
    .products-page .retail-story-heading > p:last-child { color:#785b3c; font-family:var(--serif); font-size:clamp(1.2rem,1.6vw,1.5rem); }
    .products-page .retail-story-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1.5rem; align-items:stretch; }
    .products-page .retail-story-panel { padding:clamp(1.75rem,3vw,3.5rem); border:1px solid #e3d2b9; border-radius:1.25rem; background:#fff; box-shadow:0 14px 32px #3823110c; }
    .products-page .retail-story-panel h3 { max-width:26ch; margin-top:0; font-size:clamp(1.7rem,2.4vw,2.65rem); }
    .products-page .retail-story-points { display:grid; gap:.65rem; margin-top:2rem; }
    .products-page .retail-story-points p { margin:0; padding:.85rem 1rem; border-left:3px solid var(--retail-caramel); background:#f9f1e6; border-radius:.2rem .6rem .6rem .2rem; }
    .products-page .retail-story-comparison { background:#f4e9d9; }
    .products-page .retail-bib { background:#25150d; }
    .products-page .retail-bib-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.1fr); align-items:center; gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,6rem); }
    .products-page .retail-bib h2 { color:#fff; font-size:clamp(2.6rem,4vw,4.5rem); }
    .products-page .retail-bib h3 { color:#f2c784; font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2vw,2rem); }
    .products-page .retail-bib p { color:#f2e7d9; }
    .products-page .retail-bib a:not(.btn) { color:#f2c784; }
    .products-page .retail-bib-photo { margin:0; border-radius:1.2rem; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 24px 55px #0005; }
    .products-page .retail-bib-photo img { display:block; width:100%; min-height:370px; max-height:590px; object-fit:cover; }
    .products-page .retail-audiences { background:#fffdf9; }
    .products-page .retail-audiences > .wrap > h2 { max-width:22ch; margin-bottom:2.5rem; }
    .products-page .retail-audience-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1.5rem; }
    .products-page .retail-audience-card { min-width:0; overflow:hidden; padding:clamp(1.5rem,2.5vw,3rem); border:1px solid #e3d2b9; border-radius:1.2rem; background:#f7eee2; }
    .products-page .retail-audience-card h3 { font-size:clamp(1.8rem,2.6vw,2.75rem); margin:0 0 1rem; }
    .products-page .retail-office { grid-column:1/-1; padding:0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; background:#281a11; color:#fff7ed; }
    .products-page .retail-office .retail-audience-copy { padding:clamp(2rem,4vw,4rem); }
    .products-page .retail-office h3 { color:#fff; }
    .products-page .retail-office p { color:#f0e5d9; }
    .products-page .retail-office-photo { min-width:0; height:100%; margin:0; }
    .products-page .retail-office-photo img { width:100%; height:100%; min-height:460px; object-fit:cover; display:block; }
    .products-page .retail-supply .page-media { margin:2rem 0 0; }
    .products-page .retail-supply .page-media img { max-height:340px; object-fit:contain; }
    .products-page .retail-home { background:linear-gradient(140deg,#f3e5ce,#fff9f0); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; }
    .products-page .retail-home .btn { margin-top:auto; }
    @media(max-width:900px) {
      .products-page .retail-story-grid,.products-page .retail-bib-grid,.products-page .retail-audience-grid,.products-page .retail-office { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .products-page .retail-office-photo img { min-height:300px; max-height:480px; }

      .products-page .page-hero .chips { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
      .products-page .grid.product-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
      .products-page .media-trio { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
      .products-page .media-trio > :first-child { grid-column:1/-1; }
    }
    @media(max-width:600px) {
      .products-page .wrap { width:calc(100% - 2.5rem); padding-block:3.5rem; }
      .products-page .page-hero.retail h1 { font-size:clamp(2.5rem,10vw,4rem); }
      .products-page .page-hero .chips { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .products-page .grid.product-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .products-page .product-grid .card h3 { min-height:0; }
      .products-page .product-grid .card > img { height:260px; }
      .products-page .media-trio { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .products-page .media-trio > :first-child { grid-column:auto; }
      .products-page .media-trio img,.products-page .media-trio > :not(:first-child) img { height:260px; }
      .products-page .equip { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
